Package: zupix
Title: Read and Write 'PNG', 'JPEG', 'WebP' and 'QOI' Images
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Decodes and encodes 'PNG', 'JPEG', 'WebP' and 'QOI' images
    with every codec compiled into the package, so installing it needs no
    system image library. Images decode to a native raster or to an integer
    or double array at 8 or 16 bits, and encode from the same shapes.
    Headers and metadata, including 'ICC' profiles and 'EXIF' orientation,
    are read without decoding pixels, and every size an image declares is
    checked before memory is allocated. The codecs are also available to
    other packages' C code through a registered function table.
